    "created_at": null,
    "description": "One friend on Facebook posted a message after finishing the Chicago Marathon saying she would like to run another marathon the following spring-and Chicago again in the fall. \"But isn't that against the rule that you should only run one marathon a year?\" she worried. Well, no such \"rule\" exists. And if one did exist, ... Continue reading \"Multiple Marathons\"",
